{"date":"2014-11-27","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/76/cb/367470_g574P.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/76/cb/367470_g574P.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/76/cb/367470_g574P.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/76/cb/367470_g574P.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/76/cb/367470_g574P.jpg"},"summary":"《熊出没之春日对对碰》延续《熊出没》和《熊出没之丛林总动员》轻松搞笑的风格，讲述了两头熊——熊大和熊二和人类——光头强身上发生的保卫森林家园的斗争故事。熊大是熊兄弟中的主心骨，比较聪明，机智，能随机应变，能想点子出主意；熊二性格憨直，懵懂可爱，做事冲动，直线条思维；两熊最大的敌人光头强，是个身材矮小，盗砍盗伐的伐木工。 这一部主要描述在春天的森林里，熊大熊二和光头强之间发现的和春天有关的故事，譬如赏花，植树节，花粉症等等，为了阻止光头强破坏森林，保卫自己的家园，以熊大熊二为首的丛林动物们和光头强继续展开保卫森林的斗争。","name":"熊出没之春日对对碰","name_cn":"","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":54,"total_count":159853},{"name":"童年","count":48,"total_count":92552},{"name":"原创","count":37,"total_count":614224},{"name":"TV","count":33,"total_count":1391097},{"name":"搞笑","count":29,"total_count":632726},{"name":"方特动漫","count":21,"total_count":713},{"name":"2014","count":19,"total_count":70753},{"name":"中国","count":18,"total_count":31136},{"name":"熊出没","count":16,"total_count":394},{"name":"子供向","count":10,"total_count":12567},{"name":"国漫","count":5,"total_count":15578},{"name":"2010-2019","count":4,"total_count":2170},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35475},{"name":"大长篇","count":2,"total_count":648},{"name":"3D","count":2,"total_count":50808},{"name":"续作","count":1,"total_count":45550},{"name":"治愈","count":1,"total_count":299650},{"name":"第四季","count":1,"total_count":551},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1,"total_count":492063},{"name":"动画剧集","count":1,"total_count":831},{"name":"2010年","count":1,"total_count":2384},{"name":"正番","count":1,"total_count":977},{"name":"补标","count":1,"total_count":2862},{"name":"动漫","count":1,"total_count":3994},{"name":"童年回忆","count":1,"total_count":1060},{"name":"未看完","count":1,"total_count":279}],"infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"Spring into Action of Boonie Bears"}]},{"key":"话数","value":"52"},{"key":"放送开始","v